      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Push no GitHub\n→ GitHub Actions dispara\n→ terraform init\n→ terraform plan (exibe o que vai mudar)\n→ Aprovação manual\n→ terraform apply (aplica na Oracle Cloud)",
